vFM Player - Yamaha PSS-680 samples

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks/ADPCM/PSS-680

Copy the supplied PSS-680 WAV set without renaming its files. Keep it separate from other keyboard sample sets.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks/ADPCM/PSS-680

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
